<title>SWITZERLAND: New York airports top for cargo in Jan-March 97.</title>
<headline>New York airports top for cargo in Jan-March 97.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York's three airports rated as the top major city multi-airport grouping for air cargo in the first quarter 1997 and showed an overall 3.5 percent rise to 649,963 tonnes compared to the same 1996 period, Airports Council International (ACI) statistics showed.</p>
<p>City/Airport	  Cargo	  Pct Change</p>
<p>			  Tonnes	 over 1996</p>
<p>NEW YORK		646,963	up    3.5</p>
